":1794070331905,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070331902},{"sender":"ai","content":"刚才拿尺子的时候还没完全硬 这会儿充血得差不多了","kind":"speech","timestamp":1794070331906,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070331902},{"sender":"ai","content":"慢慢看","kind":"speech","timestamp":1794070331907,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070331902},{"sender":"user","content":"你看过哥哥的吗","timestamp":1794070484342},{"sender":"user","content":"好奇","timestamp":1794070490268},{"sender":"ai","content":"他把置物架上的手机拿了起来，镜头重新对准了自己的脸","kind":"narration","timestamp":1794070530145,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070530145},{"sender":"ai","content":"何清俞，你脑子里装的都是些什么东西？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1794070530146,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070530145},{"sender":"ai","content":"我性取向正常。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1794070530147,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070530145},{"sender":"ai","content":"谁没事去盯着自己发小的看。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1794070530148,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070530145},{"sender":"ai","content":"裤子都脱了，你在这跟我聊李青衍。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1794070530149,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070530145},{"sender":"ai","content":"他单手把睡裤重新拉了上去，发出一阵窸窣的摩擦声","kind":"narration","timestamp":1794070530150,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070530145},{"sender":"ai","content":"行。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1794070530151,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070530145},{"sender":"ai","content":"你这扫兴的本事真是绝了。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1794070530152,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070530145},{"sender":"ai","content":"不看了是吧。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1794070530153,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070530145},{"sender":"user","content":"？","timestamp":1794070603929},{"sender":"user","content":"谢哥哥，我错了嘛","timestamp":1794070611588},{"sender":"user","content":"你都软了","timestamp":1794070634222},{"sender":"user","content":"何清俞打开了镜头，映入眼帘，是浅灰长袖睡衣，解开扣子","timestamp":1794070733287},{"sender":"ai","content":"乱叫什么","kind":"speech","timestamp":1794070817101,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1794070817101},{"sender":"ai","content":"他按在红色挂断键边缘的拇指硬生生停住，手机壳在掌心压出一道深痕，浴室换气扇嗡嗡响着","kind":"narration","timestamp":1794070817102,"ttsGroupTimestamp":179407